{
  "description": "the audited site's /mcp serves initialize without a token and refuses server/discover with a method-not-found, while every other request it reads a token for draws a 401 naming same-host RFC 9728 metadata that names it: no handshake asked for sign-in, so the endpoint presents the open design and the sign-in rows are n_a, and each later row whose 401 that metadata backs reads auth-required rather than broken",
  "covers": [
    "mcp-capabilities",
    "mcp-tools-list",
    "mcp-resources-list",
    "mcp-unknown-tool",
    "mcp-accept-json",
    "mcp-auth-enforced"
  ],
  "target": "https://example.com/",
  "site_type": null,
  "spec_version": "0.0.0-corpus",
  "unmatched": {
    "status": 404,
    "headers": {
      "content-type": "text/html; charset=utf-8"
    },
    "body": "<html><body><h1>Not found</h1><p>No such page.</p></body></html>"
  },
  "allow_unmatched": true,
  "exchanges": [
    {
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "https://example.com/"
      },
      "response": {
        "status": 200,
        "headers": {
          "content-type": "text/html; charset=utf-8"
        },
        "body": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Example: a site with agent entry points.\">\n<link rel=\"service-desc\" href=\"/openapi.json\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" type=\"text/markdown\" href=\"/index.md\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebSite\"}</script>\n<script src=\"/js/webmcp.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<h1>Example</h1>\n<p>Readable prose about the example service and its agent surfaces. Readable prose about the example service and its agent surfaces. Readable prose about the example service and its agent surfaces. Readable prose about the example service and its agent surfaces. </p>\n</main>\n<noscript><a href=\"/llms.txt\">llms.txt</a> <a href=\"/openapi.json\">OpenAPI</a></noscript>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://example.com/mcp",
        "body_contains": "not-json{{"
      },
      "response": {
        "status": 400,
        "headers": {
          "content-type": "application/json"
        },
        "body": "{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":1,\"error\":{\"code\":-32700,\"message\":\"nope\"}}"
      }
    },
    {
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://example.com/mcp",
        "headers": {
          "origin": "https://example.com"
        }
      },
      "response": {
        "status": 401,
        "headers": {
          "content-type": "application/json",
          "www-authenticate": "Bearer resource_metadata=\"https://example.com/.well-known/oauth-protected-resource\"",
          "access-control-allow-origin": "*",
          "access-control-allow-methods": "POST, OPTIONS",
          "access-control-allow-headers": "content-type"
        },
        "body": "{\"error\":\"unauthorized\"}"
      }
    },
    {
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://example.com/mcp",
        "body_json_method": "initialize"
      },
      "response": {
        "status": 200,
        "headers": {
          "content-type": "application/json"
        },
        "body": "{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":1,\"result\":{\"serverInfo\":{\"name\":\"example\",\"version\":\"1.0.0\"},\"protocolVersion\":\"2025-06-18\",\"capabilities\":{\"tools\":{},\"resources\":{}}}}"
      }
    },
    {
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://example.com/mcp",
        "headers": {
          "mcp-method": "server/discover"
        }
      },
      "response": {
        "status": 200,
        "headers": {
          "content-type": "application/json"
        },
        "body": "{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":1,\"error\":{\"code\":-32601,\"message\":\"nope\"}}"
      }
    },
    {
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://example.com/mcp"
      },
      "response": {
        "status": 401,
        "headers": {
          "content-type": "application/json",
          "www-authenticate": "Bearer resource_metadata=\"https://example.com/.well-known/oauth-protected-resource\""
        },
        "body": "{\"error\":\"unauthorized\"}"
      }
    },
    {
      "request": {
        "method": "OPTIONS",
        "url": "https://example.com/mcp"
      },
      "response": {
        "status": 204,
        "headers": {
          "access-control-allow-origin": "*",
          "access-control-allow-methods": "POST, OPTIONS",
          "access-control-allow-headers": "content-type"
        },
        "body": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "https://example.com/mcp"
      },
      "response": {
        "status": 401,
        "headers": {
          "content-type": "application/json",
          "www-authenticate": "Bearer resource_metadata=\"https://example.com/.well-known/oauth-protected-resource\""
        },
        "body": "{\"error\":\"unauthorized\"}"
      }
    },
    {
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "https://example.com/.well-known/oauth-protected-resource"
      },
      "response": {
        "status": 200,
        "headers": {
          "content-type": "application/json"
        },
        "body": "{\"resource\":\"https://example.com/mcp\",\"authorization_servers\":[\"https://auth.example.com\"]}"
      }
    }
  ]
}
